        Follow the existing `sprk_sessionid` grouping-key write; add the `sprk_analysis` lookup on the same `sprk_aichatsummary` upsert — do not add a new repository or a parallel write.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="PublicContracts facade" location=".claude/patterns/ai/public-contracts-facade.md">
